# OS / editor
.DS_Store

# Kit development records: only the policy README, specs of started work and
# plan journals are tracked. Draft specs, analyses, plans, task packets and
# evidence stay local.
docs/superpowers/*
!docs/superpowers/README.md
!docs/superpowers/specs/
!docs/superpowers/specs/**
!docs/superpowers/plans/
docs/superpowers/plans/**
!docs/superpowers/plans/*/
!docs/superpowers/plans/*/journal.md
.agents/tasks/
/Claude outputs/

# Python bytecode caches
__pycache__/
